### 2.2 核心表DDL

#### （1）部门表

```sql
CREATE TABLE departments (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    code VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    admin_id UUID,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

#### （2）用户表

```sql
CREATE TABLE users (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    username VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    department_id UUID REFERENCES departments(id),
    role VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'user', -- super_admin / dept_admin / user
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

#### （3）报告表

```sql
CREATE TABLE reports (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    title VARCHAR(200) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    type VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, -- department / personal
    department_id UUID REFERENCES departments(id),
    owner_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    is_public BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'draft', -- draft / generating / completed / failed / timeout / terminated
    config JSONB NOT NULL,
    current_version INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    generate_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    tags TEXT[],
    last_generated_at TIMESTAMP,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_reports_department ON reports(department_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_reports_owner ON reports(owner_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_reports_status ON reports(status);
```

#### （4）报告历史版本表

```sql
CREATE TABLE report_versions (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    report_id UUID REFERENCES reports(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    version_number INTEGER NOT NULL,
    content JSONB NOT NULL,
    config_snapshot JSONB NOT NULL,
    model_used VARCHAR(100),
    status VARCHAR(20),
    content_hash VARCHAR(64),
    generated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_versions_report ON report_versions(report_id);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_versions_report_number ON report_versions(report_id, version_number);
```

#### （5）生成任务表

```sql
CREATE TABLE generation_tasks (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    report_id UUID REFERENCES reports(id),
    trigger_type VARCHAR(20), -- manual / scheduled
    status VARCHAR(20), -- pending / running / success / failed / timeout / terminated
    started_at TIMESTAMP,
    completed_at TIMESTAMP,
    error_message TEXT,
    worker_id VARCHAR(50),
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_tasks_report ON generation_tasks(report_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_tasks_status ON generation_tasks(status);
```

#### （6）用户数据源凭证表

```sql
CREATE TABLE user_data_source_credentials (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    proxy TEXT, -- 加密存储
    cookies TEXT, -- 加密存储
    custom_headers JSONB,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_credentials_user ON user_data_source_credentials(user_id);
```

#### （7）邮件任务表

```sql
CREATE TABLE email_tasks (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    report_id UUID REFERENCES reports(id),
    trigger_type VARCHAR(20), -- auto / manual / scheduled
    recipients TEXT[] NOT NULL,
    formats TEXT[] NOT NULL, -- ['pdf', 'docx', 'md']
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'pending', -- pending / sent / failed
    scheduled_at TIMESTAMP,
    sent_at TIMESTAMP,
    error_msg TEXT,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_email_report ON email_tasks(report_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_email_status ON email_tasks(status);
```

#### （8）模型成本日志表

```sql
CREATE TABLE model_cost_logs (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    task_id UUID REFERENCES generation_tasks(id),
    model_provider VARCHAR(50),
    model_name VARCHAR(100),
    prompt_tokens INT,
    completion_tokens INT,
    total_tokens INT,
    unit_price_per_1k_tokens DECIMAL(10,6),
    estimated_cost DECIMAL(10,4),
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_cost_task ON model_cost_logs(task_id);
```

#### （9）全局外部邮箱白名单表

```sql
CREATE TABLE global_email_whitelist (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    domain VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    created_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_whitelist_domain ON global_email_whitelist(domain);
```


## 三、《前后端接口定义文档（V1.0）》

### 3.1 通用规范

**Base URL**：`/api/v1`

**认证方式**：Bearer Token（JWT）

**通用响应格式**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "message": "success",
  "data": { ... }
}
```

**错误码**：

| 错误码 | 说明 |
|--------|------|
| 0 | 成功 |
| 1001 | 未认证 |
| 1002 | 无权限 |
| 1003 | 参数错误 |
| 1004 | 资源不存在 |
| 2001 | 任务已存在 |
| 2002 | 并发限制 |
| 3001 | 模型调用失败 |
| 3002 | 抓取失败 |
| 4001 | 邮件发送失败 |


### 3.2 认证接口

#### POST /auth/login

**请求**：

```json
{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "******"
}
```

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
    "user": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "username": "zhangsan",
      "email": "zhangsan@company.com",
      "department_id": "uuid",
      "department_name": "Care业务部",
      "role": "user"
    }
  }
}
```

#### POST /auth/logout

**请求**：无

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`


### 3.3 报告管理接口

#### GET /reports

获取报告列表（带权限过滤）

**请求参数**：

| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| view | string | 否 | my / department / public / all（仅管理员） |
| department_id | string | 否 | 部门筛选 |
| tag | string | 否 | 标签筛选 |
| keyword | string | 否 | 标题搜索 |
| status | string | 否 | draft / completed / generating |
| page | int | 否 | 默认1 |
| page_size | int | 否 | 默认20 |

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "list": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "质量舆情日报",
        "type": "personal",
        "department_id": "uuid",
        "department_name": "Care业务部",
        "owner_id": "uuid",
        "owner_name": "张三",
        "is_public": true,
        "status": "completed",
        "current_version": 3,
        "generate_count": 12,
        "tags": ["质量", "舆情"],
        "last_generated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
        "created_at": "2026-08-01T08:00:00Z"
      }
    ],
    "total": 100,
    "page": 1,
    "page_size": 20
  }
}
```

#### POST /reports

创建报告

**请求**：

```json
{
  "title": "质量舆情日报",
  "description": "每日监测质量相关舆情",
  "type": "personal", // 或 "department"
  "is_public": false, // 仅personal有效
  "tags": ["质量", "舆情"],
  "config": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "module_title": "质量舆情监测",
        "model_config": {
          "provider": "ascend",
          "endpoint": "https://xxx.ascend.com/v1/chat/completions",
          "api_key": "sk-xxx",
          "model_name": "Qwen3.8-27B",
          "parameters": {
            "temperature": 0.7,
            "max_tokens": 4096
          }
        },
        "keywords": ["质量", "售后", "投诉"],
        "prompt": "你是一名服务质量管理专家...",
        "data_sources": {
          "urls": ["https://example.com/news"],
          "credential_id": "uuid" // 引用用户凭证库
        },
        "schedule": {
          "type": "daily",
          "cron": "0 8 * * *"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "created_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

#### GET /reports/{id}

获取报告详情

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "title": "质量舆情日报",
    "description": "...",
    "type": "personal",
    "department_id": "uuid",
    "department_name": "Care业务部",
    "owner_id": "uuid",
    "owner_name": "张三",
    "is_public": true,
    "status": "completed",
    "current_version": 3,
    "config": { ... },
    "tags": ["质量", "舆情"],
    "last_generated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "created_at": "2026-08-01T08:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

#### PUT /reports/{id}

更新报告配置

**请求**：同 POST /reports

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "data": {"id": "uuid", "updated_at": "..."}}`

#### DELETE /reports/{id}

删除报告（仅草稿状态可删除）

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`


### 3.4 报告生成接口

#### POST /reports/{id}/generate

触发报告生成

**请求**：

```json
{
  "force": false // true表示强制重新生成（忽略配置未变则覆盖的规则）
}
```

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "task_id": "uuid",
    "status": "pending"
  }
}
```

#### GET /reports/{id}/generate/progress

获取生成进度（SSE/WebSocket）

**响应**（SSE流）：

```
event: progress
data: {"phase": "fetching", "progress": 25, "message": "正在抓取 https://example.com/news (1/3)..."}

event: progress
data: {"phase": "generating", "progress": 60, "message": "正在调用昇腾 Qwen3.8-27B 生成..."}

event: complete
data: {"version": 3, "report_id": "uuid"}
```

#### POST /reports/{id}/generate/terminate

手动终止生成任务

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "message": "任务已终止"
}
```


### 3.5 历史版本接口

#### GET /reports/{id}/versions

获取历史版本列表

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "versions": [
      {
        "version_number": 3,
        "generated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
        "model_used": "Qwen3.8-27B",
        "status": "success",
        "is_current": true
      },
      {
        "version_number": 2,
        "generated_at": "2026-08-16T10:00:00Z",
        "model_used": "Qwen3.8-27B",
        "status": "success",
        "is_current": false
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

#### GET /reports/{id}/versions/{version}

获取特定版本内容

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "version_number": 3,
    "content": {
      "summary": "...",
      "modules": [
        {
          "module_title": "质量舆情监测",
          "content": "## 舆情趋势分析\n..."
        }
      ]
    },
    "config_snapshot": { ... },
    "model_used": "Qwen3.8-27B",
    "generated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

#### POST /reports/{id}/versions/{version}/rollback

回滚至指定版本

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "current_version": 2,
    "message": "已回滚至版本 2"
  }
}
```


### 3.6 导出接口

#### GET /reports/{id}/export

导出报告

**请求参数**：

| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| format | string | 是 | pdf / docx / md |
| version | int | 否 | 默认最新版本 |

**响应**：文件流（Content-Disposition: attachment）


### 3.7 邮件发送接口

#### POST /reports/{id}/email

发送报告邮件

**请求**：

```json
{
  "recipients": ["zhangsan@company.com", "partner@partner.com"],
  "formats": ["pdf", "docx"],
  "version": 3, // 可选，默认最新
  "scheduled_at": "2026-08-18T09:00:00Z" // 可选，定时发送
}
```

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "task_id": "uuid",
    "status": "pending"
  }
}
```

#### GET /email/tasks

获取邮件发送记录

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "list": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "report_id": "uuid",
        "report_title": "质量舆情日报",
        "recipients": ["zhangsan@company.com"],
        "formats": ["pdf"],
        "status": "sent",
        "sent_at": "2026-08-17T10:05:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```


### 3.8 模型配置接口

#### POST /models/test

测试模型连接

**请求**：

```json
{
  "provider": "ascend",
  "endpoint": "https://xxx.ascend.com/v1/chat/completions",
  "api_key": "sk-xxx",
  "model_name": "Qwen3.8-27B"
}
```

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "success": true,
    "latency_ms": 123,
    "message": "连接成功"
  }
}
```

#### GET /models/providers

获取支持的模型提供商列表

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "providers": ["ascend", "openai", "anthropic", "custom"]
  }
}
```


### 3.9 数据源凭证接口

#### GET /credentials

获取当前用户的数据源凭证列表

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "爬取A网站专用",
      "proxy": "http://***:****@192.168.1.1:8080", // 脱敏
      "cookies": "session_id=***", // 脱敏
      "custom_headers": {"Referer": "https://google.com"},
      "created_at": "2026-08-01T08:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### POST /credentials

创建数据源凭证

**请求**：

```json
{
  "name": "爬取A网站专用",
  "proxy": "http://user:pass@192.168.1.1:8080",
  "cookies": "session_id=abc123; token=xyz",
  "custom_headers": {"Referer": "https://google.com"}
}
```

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "data": {"id": "uuid"}}`

#### PUT /credentials/{id}

更新数据源凭证

**请求**：同 POST

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`

#### DELETE /credentials/{id}

删除数据源凭证

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`


### 3.10 部门管理接口（部门管理员）

#### GET /department/users

获取本部门用户列表

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "users": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "username": "zhangsan",
        "email": "zhangsan@company.com",
        "role": "user",
        "is_active": true,
        "report_count": 12,
        "last_active": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

#### POST /department/users

添加部门用户

**请求**：

```json
{
  "username": "lisi",
  "email": "lisi@company.com",
  "role": "user"
}
```

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "data": {"id": "uuid"}}`

#### PUT /department/users/{id}

更新部门用户角色

**请求**：

```json
{
  "role": "user" // 或 "dept_admin"
}
```

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`

#### DELETE /department/users/{id}

移除部门用户

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`


### 3.11 统计看板接口（部门管理员）

#### GET /dashboard/statistics

获取部门统计看板数据

**请求参数**：

| 参数 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| time_range | string | 否 | week / month / quarter，默认month |

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "generate_trend": {
      "daily": [5, 8, 3, 12, 7, 9, 4],
      "labels": ["8/11", "8/12", "8/13", "8/14", "8/15", "8/16", "8/17"]
    },
    "hot_keywords": [
      {"keyword": "质量", "count": 23},
      {"keyword": "售后", "count": 18},
      {"keyword": "投诉", "count": 14}
    ],
    "active_users": [
      {"username": "张三", "generate_count": 15},
      {"username": "李四", "generate_count": 10}
    ],
    "model_usage": [
      {"provider": "ascend", "model": "Qwen3.8-27B", "calls": 45},
      {"provider": "openai", "model": "GPT-4o", "calls": 20}
    ],
    "module_success_rate": {
      "total_attempts": 100,
      "success": 85,
      "failed": 15,
      "failure_reasons": {
        "model_error": 8,
        "fetch_timeout": 5,
        "content_empty": 2
      }
    }
  }
}
```


### 3.12 系统管理接口（超级管理员）

#### GET /admin/email-whitelist

获取全局外部邮箱白名单

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "domains": [
      {"id": "uuid", "domain": "@partner.com", "description": "合作伙伴", "created_at": "..."}
    ]
  }
}
```

#### POST /admin/email-whitelist

添加白名单域名

**请求**：

```json
{
  "domain": "@partner.com",
  "description": "合作伙伴邮箱"
}
```

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "data": {"id": "uuid"}}`

#### DELETE /admin/email-whitelist/{id}

删除白名单域名

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`

#### GET /admin/all-reports

超级管理员查看所有报告

**请求参数**：同 GET /reports，额外支持 department_id 筛选

**响应**：同 GET /reports

#### GET /admin/system/config

获取系统配置

**响应**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "smtp": {
      "host": "smtp.company.com",
      "port": 587,
      "username": "noreply@company.com",
      "tls": true
    },
    "max_concurrent_tasks": 5,
    "task_timeout_seconds": 1800
  }
}
```

#### PUT /admin/system/config

更新系统配置

**请求**：同 GET 响应结构

**响应**：`{"code": 0, "message": "success"}`


